Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This application bundles and invokes FFmpeg (which includes the x264 video encoder)
as a separate program (a distinct executable launched at runtime). FFmpeg and x264
are not linked into this application and their source code is not incorporated into
this application's own code.

FFmpeg and x264 are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3. The
full text of that license is provided in the file LICENSE-FFmpeg, and the complete
corresponding source code for the FFmpeg and x264 build distributed with this
application is available at:

    https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg

The GNU General Public License applies to the FFmpeg and x264 components only, and
does not apply to this application's own proprietary code.
